#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/site/pages/faq.ex:111
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Yes. Server connections use HTTPS/WSS with TLS encryption. Private P2P calls use WebRTC transport encryption, channel conferences use WebRTC media through your self-hosted room server, and passwords are hashed with bcrypt. The code is open source, so anyone can audit it."
msgstr ""
"对 服务器连接使用 HTTPS/WSS 使用 TLS 加密。 "
"私人P2P呼叫使用WebRTC运输加密,频道会议通过您自办的房间服务器使用WebRTC媒体,并且密码用bcrypt散开. "
"代码是开源的,所以任何人都可以审计."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/site/pages/faq.ex:100
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Your data lives in your PostgreSQL database. Regular backups mean you can restore on any new machine. Active private P2P sessions may keep working through brief server interruptions because they connect directly between users; chat, Spaces, and channel conferences depend on the server and reconnect when it returns."
msgstr ""
"您的数据保存在您的 PostgreSQL 数据库中 。 常规备份意味着可以在任何新机器上恢复. "
"活跃的私人P2P会话可能会通过短暂的服务器中断来继续工作,因为它们在用户之间直接连接;聊天,空间,和频道会议依赖于服务器,并在服务器返回时重新连接."

