msgstr "空间:每个聊天室的像素艺术世界"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/site/pages/spaces/places.html.heex:18
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Through the gate there is an empty white floor."
msgstr "通过大门,有一个空的白色地板。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/site/pages/spaces/intro.html.heex:8
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "What you type shows up above your character and in the chat."
msgstr "你打的字出现在你的角色和聊天中"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/site/pages/spaces/places.html.heex:24
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Your buildings stay in the channel, and everybody can see them."
msgstr "你们的建筑留在频道里 每个人都能看到"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/site/pages/spaces/intro.html.heex:7
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Make a character, then go in and chat."
msgstr "做个角色 然后进去聊天"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/site/pages/spaces.ex:82
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/site/pages/spaces/intro.html.heex:40
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Three characters talking on an island, in pixel art"
msgstr "三个人物在岛上说话,像素艺术"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/site/pages/spaces.ex:92
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Walk around a pixel-art world with the people of a chat room, in your browser. Make a character, talk and build together for free."
msgstr "在你的浏览器里 和聊天室里的人一起 环游一个像素艺术的世界 做一个角色,谈话和建设一起免费."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/site/pages/spaces/creator.html.heex:11
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/site/pages/spaces/how.html.heex:11
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Make your character"
msgstr "创建你的角色"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/site/pages/spaces/places.html.heex:19
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Choose furniture, plants and games in the %{build} menu and place them anywhere."
msgstr "在%{build}菜单中选择家具,植物和游戏,并放在任何地方."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/site/pages/spaces/creator.html.heex:15
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Choose the skin, the outfit, the hair, a hat and the face."
msgstr "选择皮肤,服装,头发,帽子和脸."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/site/pages/spaces/intro.html.heex:15
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/site/pages/spaces/intro.html.heex:21
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/site/pages/spaces/intro.html.heex:25
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Open the Space of %{channel}"
msgstr "打开 %{channel} 的空间"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/site/pages/spaces/places.html.heex:10
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The Construct, an empty white floor, with its %{build} menu open"
msgstr "Construct是一个空的白色地板,它的%{build}菜单打开"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/site/pages/spaces/places.html.heex:62
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "An office with computers and a meeting table"
msgstr "有电脑和会议桌的办公室"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/site/pages/spaces/how.html.heex:7
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Press %{join} on the card to open the Space in a new tab."
msgstr "按下%{join}在卡片上以新的标签打开空间."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/site/pages/spaces/intro.html.heex:6
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Everyone in the channel can walk around in it together."
msgstr "频道里每个人都可以一起走"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/site/pages/spaces/how.html.heex:13
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Walk with the arrow keys, WASD or the pad on the screen. Press Enter to write a message."
msgstr "随箭键走,WASD或屏幕上的垫. 按 Enter 键写入信件 。"

